1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,130
A nut must follow a bolt thread instead of simply moving straight down.
螺母要沿螺纹前进，不能直接向下穿过去。

2
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:13,910
Factory makes these detailed contact interactions fast enough for large-scale robot learning, while preserving the geometry that makes assembly difficult.
Factory 保留复杂几何，同时让接触仿真足够快。

3
00:00:14,489 --> 00:00:19,729
Signed distance fields describe how far sampled points lie from the opposing surface.
有符号距离场描述采样点到对侧表面的距离。

4
00:00:20,209 --> 00:00:27,409
They support collision queries on complex parts, including threads, without reducing every object to a few simple convex shapes.
这样可检测复杂螺纹接触，减少简化几何的损失。

5
00:00:27,986 --> 00:00:34,266
The simulator reduces redundant contact constraints before solving the remaining interactions on the GPU.
求解前先缩减冗余接触约束，再交给 GPU。

6
00:00:34,866 --> 00:00:41,906
This combination matters because thousands of detailed contact points would otherwise make parallel training too expensive to run efficiently.
否则大量细节接触会拖慢并行训练。

7
00:00:42,629 --> 00:00:48,829
The release combines assembly assets, simulation environments, and several robot controllers.
工作提供装配资产、仿真环境和多种控制器。

8
00:00:49,789 --> 00:00:56,529
Policies learn from simulator states and geometric rewards, so this study does not need a dataset of human assembly demonstrations.
策略依靠仿真状态与几何奖励，不需要人工装配示教。

9
00:00:57,459 --> 00:01:02,559
PPO separately learns to pick the nut, place it above the bolt, and screw it down.
PPO 分别学习拿起、放到螺栓上方和旋入。

10
00:01:03,019 --> 00:01:09,299
The resulting policies are then chained, exposing failures that are hidden when each individual skill is tested alone.
串联之后，才能看到独立子技能测试漏掉的失败。

11
00:01:09,850 --> 00:01:16,730
The final screw policy succeeds in eighty-five point six percent of one thousand twenty-four simulated episodes.
最终旋入策略在一千零二十四次仿真中成功八十五点六。

12
00:01:17,370 --> 00:01:22,884
Success requires reaching within one thread pitch of the bolt base, rather than merely catching the thread.
要进入距螺栓底部一牙间距内，不能只挂牙。

13
00:01:23,334 --> 00:01:30,254
When picking, placing, and screwing are combined, reported simulated success falls to seventy-four point two percent.
拿取、放置、旋入串联后，仿真成功率七十四点二。

14
00:01:30,714 --> 00:01:37,034
Those two numbers describe different evaluation settings, and neither is a measured success rate on a physical robot.
两组评测条件不同，也都不是真机成功率。

15
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:43,820
The strongest screw setup restricts actions and removes an end-joint limit to avoid regrasping.
较强旋入设置限制动作维度，并放开关节限位。

16
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:52,220
Thin geometry, realistic friction, and transferring the learned policies to hardware remain separate challenges beyond fast simulated contact.
重抓、薄壁、摩擦和真机迁移仍需单独解决。

17
00:01:52,813 --> 00:01:59,073
Factory contributes the training infrastructure that makes detailed assembly experiments practical at scale.
Factory 的价值，是支撑规模化的细节装配实验。

18
00:01:59,433 --> 00:02:08,913
To judge deployment readiness, follow the evidence onward to physical perception, calibration, compliant execution, and complete real-world task trials.
真正部署还要验证感知、标定、柔顺执行与完整任务。
